From 4c0f9be7fc7fdfef03f1c2b6d4449b4d42b0d696 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 17:37:55 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 01/11] restructure into hosts/laptop + modules/nixos (no
 change in the result)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- laptop.nix (419 lines) split into one module per topic under
  modules/nixos: boot, nix, locale, networking, vpn, desktop, audio,
  security, printing, power, devices, development
- hosts/laptop: default.nix (hostname, user, home-manager, reMarkable,
  go2) and hardware.nix (only the generated hardware part; boot loader,
  LUKS unlock and Bluetooth moved to modules)
- flake.nix only declares inputs and the laptop host
- Projecteur overlay in pkgs/overlay.nix
- remarkable-sync moved to modules/nixos/remarkable, scripts next to
  their topic (nvim/diff-plugins.nix, niri/beamer-mirror.nix)

Verified: the system derivation (incl. home-manager) is identical to
before (nixos-system-progressio …42grh9396knj…).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011ZuxjHwJWLzvZgbYArzrwc
